---
import Starfield from './Starfield.astro';
---
<section class="about section-block" id="about">
  <Starfield />
  <div class="about__copy reveal">
    <p class="section-label">About Grashof</p>
    <div class="red-rule"></div>
    <h2>Current Work.<br />Future R&amp;D.</h2>
    <p class="about__lead">格拉索專注熱流工程、數位孿生熱管理與 AI 落地應用</p>
    <p>未來研發聚焦衛星熱管理與太空電磁干擾防護</p>
  </div>

  <div class="about__layers reveal">
    <article><span>CORE · 核心領域</span><h3>Thermal Digital Twin &amp; Applied AI</h3><p>熱流工程解決方案、數位孿生熱管理，協助客戶建置 AI 落地應用</p></article>
    <article><span>CURRENT APPLICATIONS · 目前應用</span><h3>Industrial Vision · Custom AI &amp; API Applications</h3><p>工業視覺、客製 AI 與 API 系統，從客戶需求設計到實際導入</p></article>
    <article><span>FUTURE R&amp;D · 研發方向</span><h3>Satellite Thermal · EMI Protection</h3><p>衛星熱管理系統與太空電磁干擾防護技術，研發中（Under Development）</p></article>
  </div>

  <dl class="company-facts reveal">
    <div><dt>Legal entity</dt><dd>格拉索工業有限公司</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Brand</dt><dd>Grashof</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Based in</dt><dd>Taiwan</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Focus</dt><dd>Thermal Digital Twin &amp; Applied AI Solution</dd></div>
  </dl>
  <span class="section-number">05 / 06</span>
</section>
